        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dee-bid kɛnɛ Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid thiec i̱, “Tëë kɛ ram mi ci duɔth dhɔr Thɔɔl, mi dëë ciɛŋ agɔaa kɛ kui̱ Jo-na-than?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëë kɛ ja̱ŋ Thɔɔl mi cɔal i̱ Dhiba, cua cio̱l Dee-bid. Kä cu kuäär ɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n Dhiba?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ jɛn ɣän ja̱ŋdu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Thilɛ ram mi ci duɔth dhɔr Thɔɔl mi dëë nyuɔ̱th gɔɔy Kuɔth?” Kä cu Dhiba kuäär loc i̱, “Te gat Jo-na-than thi̱n. Duundɛ ɣöö ɛ ŋɔl ciökä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ɛ jiök i̱, “Kä ja nikä?” Kä cu Dhiba kuäär loc i̱, “Ja dhɔr Ma-kir gat A-mi-el kä Lo-da-bar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ram mi wä jɛ no̱o̱ŋ dhɔr Ma-kir gat A-mi-el kä Lo-da-bar ja̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth gat Jo-na-than gat Thɔɔl ben kä Dee-bid, kä cuɛ rɔ goŋ nhiamdɛ luthä. Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jiök i̱, “Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth!” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Ja̱ŋdu ɛn kuäär.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jiök i̱, “/Cu dual. Kɛ ɣöö bä ji̱ nyuɔ̱th gɔɔy kɛ kui̱ guur ni Jo-na-than, kä bä ji̱ luɔ̱c mun guurdɔɔŋ ni Thɔɔl kɛɛliw. Kä ban mi̱th kɛɛl ni ciaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth rɔ goŋ luthä wee i̱, “Kä ɛ ɣän ŋa, bi guic ni ɣän ramɛ thil luɔt ɛ?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Dhiba cɔl, kuany Thɔɔl, kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Kɛn tin diaal tin la nyin Thɔɔl tin la nyin dhɔaarɛ, cä kɛ ka̱m gat kua̱ru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n yɛnɛ gaatku kɛ la̱a̱tku bia jɛ pi̱eth mun, kä bia bɛlkɛ nööŋ kɛ ɣöö bɛ tëë mi̱eth mi cam gat kua̱ru jɛ. Duundɛ ɣöö bi Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth mi̱th kɛɛl kɛ ɣä.” Kä te Dhiba kɛ gaat wäl dhieec kɛ la̱a̱t ti jiɛɛn rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dhiba kuäär jiök i̱, “Ce̱tnikɛ min ci la̱rä kuäärä, bä jɛ la̱t, kä nikɛ min ci la̱rä i̱, ‘Bi Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth mi̱th kɛɛl kɛ ɣä ce̱tkɛ gat kua̱r.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth tekɛ gat mi ŋuɛ̈t mi cɔali Mika. Kä cu tin diaal tin cieŋ dhɔr Dhiba a ja̱a̱ŋ Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ-pi-bo-cɛth ciɛŋ ni Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. Kɛ ɣöö mi̱thɛ kɛɛl kɛ kuäär. Kä jɛn ɛ ŋɔl ciöknikɛ da̱ŋ rɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
